    "about_the_game": "<strong>Warning:</strong> This is a <strong>DEMO</strong> version of the final game. We are <strong>4 recently graduated Portuguese Game Developers</strong> <u>trying to start a Game Studio</u>.<br><strong>Every donation is appreciated</strong> and will contribute to the <strong>development of new games</strong> and to <strong>improve quality</strong>.<br><u>Contact us via our Discord server -&gt;</u> (<i>#open-ticked</i>) <u>if you want to contribute</u>.<br>Thank you, 3PA Studios.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Be the captain of a Portuguese ship on a daring journey from Lisbon to Japan! </h2>Don't expect an easy ride, there are <strong>over 20 locations</strong>, <strong>50 tradable items</strong>, and <strong>multiple ships</strong> that <u>will not hesitate to steal them from you</u>.<br>Choose your <strong>play style</strong>... <strong>warriors, medics, cooks, entertainers, or sailors</strong>. <i>A mix of all?</i><br>Think carefully before making any decision, they will <strong>influence your future</strong> and also <strong>how the rest of the world sees you</strong>. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Reputation <i> - Negotiators might not like a captain with a bad reputation... </i><br></li><li>Crew Morale <i> - Be careful with riots... </i><br></li><li>Crew Health <i> - You don't want your crew sick.. trust me. </i></li></ul>Along the way, there are multiple references to <strong>historical battles</strong> and items from Portuguese culture. Use your <strong>nautical journal</strong> to keep track of everything.<br><u> Are you the chosen one to reach Japan? </u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/b477ef379e83c3087d038a9f200c5451.avif?t=1709136030\" width=421 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/053040f4081eb4941deb23af89482f03.poster.avif?t=1709136030\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/053040f4081eb4941deb23af89482f03.webm?t=1709136030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/053040f4081eb4941deb23af89482f03.mp4?t=1709136030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Pirates... they can cause some trouble but the reward could be worth it.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/f124b34a40dd3412e612ff35b0592101.avif?t=1709136030\" width=421 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/2a99140e1cd752ac130c9b19303ce275.poster.avif?t=1709136030\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/2a99140e1cd752ac130c9b19303ce275.webm?t=1709136030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/2a99140e1cd752ac130c9b19303ce275.mp4?t=1709136030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>You are the Captain! Tell your crew where to go.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/48d21ee1dc5fa27c58ce04b0f433d380.avif?t=1709136030\" width=421 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2692450/extras/1863bd38c026450a1fafe27f4aca2c20.poster.avif?t=1709136030\" width=450 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a